    ["<Assistant_Title1>初战高原</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-势力\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成1局高原战"] = "<Assistant_Title1>First Battle on the Plateau</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven Growth - Faction\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete 1 match of Plateau War",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>装备重塑</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n\n1、当前赛季中，武器、护甲、胸针、帽子部位将依次解锁词条重塑功能。解锁后，可消耗蓝山晶石对装备进行重塑，获得随机的装备词条。\n\n2、未解锁重塑的部位，仍可进行词条保存和应用。例如：通过玩法获得带有2条非凡词条的指环时，该词条组合将自动保存，可在重塑界面右侧的“恩赐”中应用到任意指环。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>道具获取：</>可通过分解装备、报销商店兑换等方式获取蓝山晶石。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Equipment Reshaping </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </>\n\n 1. In the current season, the Weapon, Armor, Brooch, and Hat slots will unlock the affix reshaping function sequentially. Once unlocked, you can consume Blue Mountain Crystals to reshape equipment and obtain random equipment affixes. \n\n 2. Slots that have not unlocked reshaping can still have their affixes saved and applied. For example, when obtaining a ring with 2 Extraordinary affixes through gameplay, the combination is automatically saved and can be applied to any ring via the \"Gift\" section on the right of the Reshape interface. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Item Acquisition: </> Blue Mountain Crystals can be obtained by dismantling equipment or exchanging in the Reimbursement Shop.",
